     bindings = <
    // ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷   ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷

                    XXX         &kp AT      &kp HASH    &kp DLLR    &kp PRCNT       &kp ASTRK   &kp LPAR    &kp RPAR   &kp MINUS    &kp EQUAL
                    ___         ___     &hml LALT TILDE &hml LGUI PIPE &kp CARET    &kp AMPS    &hmr LGUI LBKT &hmr LALT RBKT &hmr LCTRL GRAVE &hmr RSHIFT BSLH
        ___         XXX         ___         &kp LT      &kp GT      &kp FSLH        &kp UNDER   &kp LBRC    &kp RBRC   &kp PLUS    &kp EXCL    ___
